# The Temple of Uggalepih: section 2 (another Zilart mission current, battlefieldWin the Temple). Main (the
# mission current) and eve (completed, Headstone Pilgrimage current) enter area 1 and kill the three
# Gravitons (by id): 32001 to both. A GM sets eve's battlefieldWin to 128; eve's finish gives the Bearer of
# the Wisewoman's Hope title (section 2). Main's finish sets status 1 (section 1).
# Each kill also counts EVERYONES_GRUDGE_KILLS for both (Everyone's Grudge, another script).
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/onZoneIn/1 SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/7 SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/8 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/7 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/8 SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrade SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=SacrificialChamber pos=299,0.1,349 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=SacrificialChamber pos=299,0.1,349 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih current
keyitem SacrificialChamberKey
eve: mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
eve: mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
eve: mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
eve: mission Soa Abomination current
eve: mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih completed
eve: mission Zilart HeadstonePilgrimage current
login
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _4j0
update 32000 option=1                   # index 0, area 1: entered
finish
eve: trigger _4j0
eve: update 32000 option=1
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill GRAVITON
kill GRAVITON+1
kill GRAVITON+2                         # all three dead: won, 32001 to both
eve: localvar battlefieldWin 128        # a GM: the Temple's id
eve: finish                             # section 2: the title
finish                                  # main: status 1 (section 1)
